meta {
  name: Post Chat (AI)
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/chat/ai
  body: json
  auth: none
}

body:json {
  {
    "question": "can you find my vehicle with the most trip?"
  }
}

docs {
  # Post Chat (AI)

  This AI request is used to do analyze and find data using command (prompt) to select context query. This request interacts with the MySQL database.

  ## Responses

  **200 — chat answered successfully**
```json
  {
    "status": "success",
    "message": "lorem ipsum"
  }
```

  **400 — {validation_msg}**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "{field validation message}"
  }
```

  **401 — protected route need to include sign in token as authorization bearer**
```json
  {
    "status": "failed",
    "message": "you need to include the authorization token from login"
  }
```

  **500 — Internal Server Error**
```json
  {
    "status": "error",
    "message": "something wrong. please contact admin"
  }
```
}